WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Fictional starting profile: a short written outline.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Change to a concrete page example, then save.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.400
The saved edit is version 2. Open History.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.000
View the complete version 1 snapshot.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.200
Restore version 1.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.200
Confirmation accepted; not visible.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.600
Earlier wording returns as version 3.
Version 2 stays in history.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.800
Reload the actual Settings page.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.080
After reload: versions 3, 2 and 1 remain.
